# 🌾 Agricultural Analytics

## 📌 Project Overview

Agricultural Analytics is a data analytics project designed to analyze crop production, sales, farmers, and agricultural performance using **SQL Server and Power BI**.

The project helps understand crop-wise production, farmer performance, sales trends, and other important agricultural business insights.

## 🎯 Objectives

* Analyze crop production and yield.
* Analyze agricultural sales and revenue.
* Understand farmer-wise production.
* Compare crop performance.
* Identify useful business insights from agricultural data.
* Create an interactive Power BI dashboard.

